                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Fletcher to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-12T15:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 12, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. Carranza elected President yesterday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
